OL,3,GNEWSAMan who fired shots near mosque
OL,4,Awas shooting at rabbits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested after gunshots were
OL,7,Fheard outside a mosque had been firing
OL,8,Fat rabbits in a car park, magistrates
OL,9,Fhave accepted.
OL,11,FIan Peart, 44, was detained after an
OL,12,Fincident in which he was seen using an
OL,13,Fair rifle in the early hours of 30 July
OL,14,Fnear to York Mosque.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
