OL,3,GNEWSAMan who fired shots near mosque
OL,4,Awas shooting at rabbits
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday prosecutors said Peart's
OL,7,Fexplanation "appears to have been
OL,8,Faccepted" by police and that the
OL,9,Fdefendant had insisted there was "no
OL,10,Fintention to cause anyone any harm" and
OL,11,F"no evidence on the file to suggest
OL,12,Fthat it was in any way an anti-Muslim
OL,13,Fcase."
OL,15,FPeart appeared at York Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt where he was fined after he
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to possession of a
OL,18,Floaded air weapon in a public place.
